ent to the market.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · Then I went to my aunt's.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Enfin, j'ai regardé un film.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · Finally, I watched a film.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>La semaine prochaine, je vais voyager.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · Next week I'm going to travel.</span></li></ul>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275995,"_nanoseconds":943000000}},{"id":"ATm241DEkbJGUxtHpzw9","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":3,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p03-b1","partTitle":"Say it 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Samedi matin, j'ai fait le marché.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Saturday morning, I went to the market.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Samedi matin, j'ai fait le marché.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275995,"_nanoseconds":912000000}},{"id":"Q2kRHLprO32ZXuRhcKCp","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":4,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p04-b1","partTitle":"Say it 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Then I went to my aunt's.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275995,"_nanoseconds":905000000}},{"id":"T5ulSgiHl8sOndL5D6JW","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":5,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p05-b1","partTitle":"Say it 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Enfin, j'ai regardé un film.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Finally, I watched a film.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Enfin, j'ai regardé un film.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275995,"_nanoseconds":902000000}},{"id":"HsvCpXfzqzDNufE7sOH1","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>La semaine prochaine, je vais voyager.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Next week I'm going to travel.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"La semaine prochaine, je vais voyager.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":369000000}},{"id":"bYmXDfdMJS7MxrTmxmSC","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Alors, votre week-end ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">So, your weekend?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Samedi matin, j'ai fait le marché.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Saturday morning, I went to the market.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et après ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And after?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Then I went to my aunt's.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous avez mangé là-bas ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Did you eat there?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Oui, nous avons mangé du riz et du poisson.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, we ate rice and fish.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et dimanche ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And Sunday?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Dimanche, j'ai dormi, et le week-end prochain, je vais voyager.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Sunday I slept, and next weekend I'm going to travel.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":370000000}},{"id":"Inn9OxhFkbfyGA8dhP7z","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Alors, votre week-end ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">So, your weekend?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Samedi matin, j'ai fait le marché.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Saturday morning, I went to the market.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Samedi matin, j'ai fait le marché.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":366000000}},{"id":"5bSiJId1lqV7rLWKa95X","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageU