rn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Dimanche, j'ai dormi, et le week-end prochain, je vais voyager.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":778000000}},{"id":"nN6dG5xizYmBemhTmtGE","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Racontez votre week-end.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Tell me about your weekend.</p><p><b>Tell three things you did in order, then one plan.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “D'abord, j'ai fait le marché. Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante. Enfin, j'ai dormi.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"D'abord, j'ai fait le marché. Ensuite, je suis allé chez ma tante. Enfin, j'ai dormi.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":829000000}},{"id":"XuINOkiVpMN05g14Shlo","level":"a1","lesson":24,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a1-l24-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">📖</div><p><b>Storyteller!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can tell a short story in order. This is real speaking, not just answering.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275996,"_nanoseconds":842000000}}]